  "description": "An exceptional three-bedroom, three-bathroom luxury apartment ideally positioned in the heart of Dublin 2, offering an unrivalled combination of sophisticated design, premium finishes and outstanding outdoor living space.\nLocated on the second floor of one of Dublin's most prestigious residential developments, this stunning dual-aspect residence extends to approximately 126 sq.m (1,345 sq.ft).\n\nThe accommodation is centred around a magnificent open-plan kitchen, dining and living space designed for both everyday comfort and elegant entertaining. The award-winning German-designed Allmilmo kitchen features floor-to-ceiling cabinetry, exquisite Arabescato marble worktops and splashbacks, integrated Siemens appliances, an Insinkerator hot water tap and a built-in coffee station.\n\nThe apartment comprises three generously proportioned double bedrooms, two of which benefit from luxurious ensuite bathrooms. Each bedroom enjoys direct access to a private covered terrace overlooking beautifully landscaped communal gardens and the Dublin skyline. \nA beautifully appointed main bathroom, together with an exceptionally spacious utility and boot room with integrated sink and additional storage, further enhances the practicality of this remarkable home.\n\nResidents benefit from access to an impressive rooftop terrace with panoramic views across Dublin City and Dublin Bay, as well as beautifully landscaped communal gardens and recreational areas.\n\nTwo secure underground car parking spaces and a private basement storage room are included with the property.\n\nPerfectly positioned just off Baggot Street, this exclusive address places residents within minutes of St. Stephen's Green, Ballsbridge, Ranelagh, Grand Canal Dock and Dublin's leading financial, technology and professional services districts.\n\nLocation\nSituated in one of Dublin's most sought-after residential locations, this exceptional apartment is within walking distance of St. Stephen's Green, Baggot Street, Grand Canal Dock, Ballsbridge and Ranelagh. A superb selection of cafés, restaurants, boutiques, parks and transport links are all on the doorstep, making this an ideal residence for those seeking luxury city living at its finest.\n\n\nFeatures\n•\tLuxury second-floor apartment extending to approximately 126 sq.m (1,345 sq.ft)\n•\tThree spacious double bedrooms\n•\tThree bathrooms including two ensuite bathrooms\n•\tThree private covered terraces\n•\tAward-winning Allmilmo designer kitchen\n•\tArabescato marble worktops and splashbacks\n•\tIntegrated Siemens appliances\n•\tHive smart heating controls\n•\tDimmable LED lighting and designer light fittings\n•\tThermostatic zoned underfloor heating\n•\tHeat recovery ventilation system\n•\tHigh acoustic performance construction\n•\tTwo secure underground parking spaces\n•\tPrivate basement storage room\n•\tLandscaped communal gardens\n•\tSpectacular residents' rooftop terrace\n•\tBER A2\n•\tPrime Dublin 2 location",
